Glad it's working now!

Quick thought: the `conflicted <https://github.com/r-lib/conflicted>` package can help you determine what packages have functions of the same name.

In practice I never use the package other than to "discover" conflicts, because it's pretty strict and prompts you every time you use a function belonging to multiple packages.

